#X obj 653 8 conv.lab2rgb;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 235 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 277 Wiki:;
#X text 240 83 The object converts CIELAB color values (L* \, a* \,
b*) to RGB values. The L* component (lightness) is given in the range
[0 \, 1] \, and the a* and b* components (chromaticity) are given in
the range [-1 \, 1]. By default the RGB values are output as integers
in the range [0 \, 255]; with the @float flag they are output as floats
in the range [0 \, 1]. By default the three channel values are sent
to three separate outlets; if the @pack flag is set \, they are packed
into a single list sent to the first outlet. With the @sync flag \,
the object outputs a new value whenever any inlet changes.;
#X obj 280 279 ui.link @background_color 0.90196 0.90196 0.90196
@title CIELAB color space @url
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CIELAB_color_space;
